  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/Impro1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este viernes 16 de marzo se ha celebrado en el Teatro M&oacute;naco la gran gala final</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/Impro4.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>de la <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=74881\" target=\"_blank\">VI liga de improvisaci&oacute;n de Onda</a>. El mejor jugador ha sido proclamado Jorge Mart&iacute; Contreras y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/Impro3.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>han recibido la camiseta acreditativa sus sobrinas Aitana y Vega Mart&iacute; Catal&aacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/Impro2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha actuado en directo el grupo ondense de m&uacute;sica en valenciano Epicentre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalligaimprovisaciononda/img_2610.jpg\" alt=\"img_2610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalligaimprovisaciononda/img_2612.jpg\" alt=\"img_2612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalligaimprovisaciononda/img_2613.jpg\" alt=\"img_2613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalligaimprovisaciononda/img_2615.jpg\" alt=\"img_2615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalligaimprovisaciononda/img_2617.jpg\" alt=\"img_2617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f2